"n": "#36·24",
"text": "This beige dress is made of soft chiffon and features a relaxed V-neckline with a central front zipper. The fabric has a classic plaid pattern in varying shades of light neutral tones, creating an effortless look that falls straight from the gathered waist to a comfortable knee-length hem."
},
{
"n": "#295·06",
"text": "This structured handbag is crafted from pebbled brown leather with a distinct knot design adorning the front strap. It features two top handles and a compact dome shape, offering a polished contrast to the lighter dress you are wearing."
},
{
"n": "#245·24",
"text": "These earrings are classic spherical studs finished in warm gold metal with a subtle pearl-like sheen. They sit cleanly against the skin without extending beyond the earlobe."
},
{
"n": "#127·04",
"text": "These shoes are crafted from soft suede in a matching beige tone, featuring a cozy white shearling lining peeking out at the top. They have a moccasin-style construction with decorative stitching and a chunky rubber sole for comfortable walking."
}
]
